  "body": "Located between native bush and the golden sands of Orewa Beach, this single-level home offers a great lifestyle at a price that actually makes sense. Forget weekend DIY and endless renovations, you'll have time to enjoy the great local lifestyle. \r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms / 2 Bathrooms (No morning queues!)\r\nInternal Access Garage for safety and storage.\r\nPerfect for: First-home buyers, downsizers, or savvy investors.\r\n\r\nCall me now for a no-obligation chat.\r\n- Custom designed kitchen\r\n- Open plan living\r\n- Sunny, elevated section\r\n- Concrete driveway and patios\r\n- Internal Access\r\n- Master Builders 10 year Guarantee\r\n- Building and resource consent fees\r\n- High quality fittings and fixtures\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPrice shown includes house and land, but is subject to terms, conditions and excludes additional siteworks/foundation costs above standard allowances unless otherwise stated. Images and photos are examples only.",
